        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Three horizontal rows of sprays of single flowers, two blue and cream, the middle one dark red and cream, woven in silks on a ground of gold colored silk damask with a very large symmetrical floral pattern.  Composed of several pieces, some with selvedges of several narrow stripes.  Very worn, many holes, some repaired with running stitches."@en ;
